  "description": "Drop-in replacement shim for ELMAH (Error Logging Modules and Handlers),\n      the deprecated .NET error-logging library for legacy ASP.NET applications.\n      Replace your elmah NuGet reference with Rokstep.Elmah.Shims and your existing\n      code continues to work on .NET 6/8 without changes. Internally delegates to\n      Microsoft.Extensions.Logging, Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http, and\n      System.Threading.Channels. Every public type is marked [Obsolete] with\n      DiagnosticId \"RKSEL####\" pointing to migration guidance — this is a\n      transitional package to be removed after full migration to modern .NET\n      logging patterns (Microsoft.Extensions.Logging + Sentry / Application\n      Insights / OpenTelemetry).",
